text:
@alan678.bsky.social theme for #BirdOfTheDay is #PowerPose, any bird showing strength through its stance, the Alt theme is #FeedingFrenzy, any bird in a rush to eat.
Here's a Goldfinch & Coal Tit in their #PowerPose and a Jay munching the nuts in a #FeedingFrenzy

